Gremlins can only steal from a certain hard-coded subset of intrinsics.
These are:
* Fire resistance
* Teleportation (aka teleportitis)
* Poison resistance
* Telepathy
* Cold resistance
* Invisibility
* See invisible
* Speed
* Stealth
* Aggravate monster

All of the other intrinsics (sleep resistance, shock resistance etc.)
cannot be taken. Also, gremlins can't steal intrinsics conferred by
polymorphed forms. Y'know, because stealing a fire elemental's fire
resistance is just dumb.


